       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "23260140"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Participates in the translocation of transit peptide-containing proteins across the mitochondrial inner membrane. Also required for assembly of mitochondrial respiratory chain complex I and complex IV as component of the MITRAC (mitochondrial translation regulation assembly intermediate of cytochrome c oxidase complex) complex. Probably shuttles between the presequence translocase and respiratory-chain assembly intermediates in a process that promotes incorporation of early nuclear-encoded subunits into these complexes"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
