       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "26321642"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Component of the TIM23 complex. Component of the MITRAC (mitochondrial translation regulation assembly intermediate of cytochrome c oxidase complex) complex, the core components of this complex being COA3/MITRAC12 and COX14 (Probable) (PubMed:23260140). Interacts with COA3 and MT-CO1/COX1 (PubMed:26321642)"
    }
   ],
